stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Active
  state Active {
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Running : start job
    Idle --> Failed : bad config
    Running --> Paused : pause requested
    Paused --> Running : resume requested
    Running --> Failed : crash detected
    Paused --> Failed : timeout while paused
    Failed --> Idle : operator reset
  }
  Active --> Archived : retire
  Archived --> [*]
